      "heading": "Core Production Modes > Mode 1: Quick Edit (1→1)",
      "requirement": "Acceptance Target 1: Poor ASR can be repaired (EC-M07-Q01). Detects Vietnamese filler words and dead pauses. Supports text and timestamp repairs with temporal consistency check. When temporal ordering fails, marks manual fallback mode with explicit notification: 'Auto-alignment failed. [Try segment mode] or [Manual cut].'",
      "evidence": [
        "apps/api/internal/production/quickedit_test.go:TestASRRepairAndFallback_AcceptanceTarget1",
        "apps/web/src/lib/production/quickedit.test.ts:repairWordTranscript handles valid updates and triggers fallback on invalid alignment",
        "apps/mobile/test/quick_edit_acceptance_test.dart:Acceptance Target 1: Detects Vietnamese fillers and supports ASR repair with fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/02_features/production/ai_video_studio.md",
      "heading": "Core Production Modes > Mode 1: Quick Edit (1→1)",
      "requirement": "Acceptance Target 2: Correct ratio/audio/subtitles. Auto-reframe crop calculation for 9:16 vertical, 16:9 landscape, and 1:1 square. Loudnorm audio normalization to -14.0 LUFS with EBU R128 compliance check. Animated subtitle styling filters (bounce, karaoke, highlight, typewriter). Librosa-style beat grid alignment. ACRCloud copyright fingerprint scanning with royalty-free alternatives.",
      "evidence": [
        "apps/api/internal/production/quickedit_test.go:TestAspectAudioSubtitlesBeatCopyright_AcceptanceTarget2",
        "apps/web/src/lib/production/quickedit.test.ts:calculateQuickEditCredits accurately sums base and addon features",
        "apps/mobile/test/quick_edit_acceptance_test.dart:Acceptance Target 2: Accurate credit calculation for base + add-ons"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/02_features/production/ai_video_studio.md",
      "heading": "Core Production Modes > Mode 1: Quick Edit (1→1)",
      "requirement": "Acceptance Target 3: Deleted text maps to intended segment. Transcript word strikethrough deletion converts text edits to video cut segments. Adjacent cuts within coalesce threshold (80ms) are merged. Retained timeline segments are computed with verified zero drift across segments.",
      "evidence": [
        "apps/api/internal/production/quickedit_test.go:TestDeletedTextMappingAndZeroDrift_AcceptanceTarget3",
        "apps/web/src/lib/production/quickedit.test.ts:buildCutIntervals coalesces adjacent cuts within 80ms threshold",
        "apps/web/src/lib/production/quickedit.test.ts:computeRetainedTimeline calculates non-deleted segments with zero drift",
        "apps/mobile/test/quick_edit_acceptance_test.dart:Acceptance Target 3: Strikethrough words map to cuts with adjacent coalescing and zero drift"
      ]
    }
